                <Title>Cancer epidemiology, biomarkers &amp; prevention : a publication of the American Association for Cancer Research, cosponsored by the American Society of Preventive Oncology</Title>
                <ISOAbbreviation>Cancer Epidemiol. Biomarkers Prev.</ISOAbbreviation>
